    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Created by Chris Mason at Oracle and merged into the mainline kernel in Linux 2.6.29.",
      "source_hash": 15969431726130741388,
      "context_hash": 9217579869134748008,
      "translation": "Oracle의 Chris Mason이 만들었으며 Linux 2.6.29에서 메인라인 커널에 병합되었습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Linux": "Linux",
        "kernel": "커널",
        "mainline": "메인라인"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:50:14.112145Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "See [A short history of btrfs](https://lwn.net/Articles/342892/) (LWN) for the design story.",
      "source_hash": 14706421993894857433,
      "context_hash": 3118841693887289159,
      "translation": "설계 배경은 [A short history of btrfs](https://lwn.net/Articles/342892/)(LWN)를 참고하십시오.",
