    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "B-tree structure",
      "source_hash": 5766612859846210200,
      "context_hash": 9819555934998060480,
      "translation": "B-tree 구조",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "B-tree": "B-tree"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:50:18.238340Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Everything in Btrfs is stored in B-trees (hence \"B-tree filesystem\"), a design inspired by ReiserFS and ZFS concepts.",
      "source_hash": 13981386692892332055,
      "context_hash": 9895758355393401926,
      "translation": "Btrfs의 모든 것은 B-tree에 저장되며(그래서 \"B-tree filesystem\"이라는 이름이 붙었습니다), 이는 ReiserFS와 ZFS의 개념에서 영감을 받은 설계입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "B-tree": "B-tree",
        "B-trees": "B-tree",
        "btrfs": "btrfs"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:50:18.238340Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "There is no separate inode table or block bitmap — all metadata lives in these trees:",
      "source_hash": 6833854858524344129,
      "context_hash": 1079648379885940951,
      "translation": "별도의 inode 테이블이나 블록 비트맵은 없으며, 모든 메타데이터는 이 트리들 안에 존재합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "bitmap": "비트맵",
        "inode": "inode",
        "metadata": "메타데이터"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:50:18.238341Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "B-tree node format",
      "source_hash": 16091347302060700651,
      "context_hash": 16037901378007556439,
      "translation": "B-tree 노드 형식",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "B-tree": "B-tree",
        "node": "노드"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:50:18.238341Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Keys",
      "source_hash": 3547182230166215071,
      "context_hash": 15757581375701847417,
      "translation": "키",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:50:18.238341Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Every item in every Btrfs tree has a 3-part key:",
      "source_hash": 5007548624166398924,
      "context_hash": 6015776349434983873,
      "translation": "모든 Btrfs 트리의 모든 항목은 세 부분으로 이루어진 키를 가집니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "btrfs": "btrfs"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:50:18.238342Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Copy-on-write semantics",
      "source_hash": 4730892253835123344,
      "context_hash": 11848299256752229055,
      "translation": "Copy-on-write 의미론",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "copy-on-write": "copy-on-write"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:50:18.238342Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Btrfs never overwrites data in place.",
      "source_hash": 15413947296896632826,
      "context_hash": 9429578696915845023,
      "translation": "Btrfs는 데이터를 절대 제자리에서 덮어쓰지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "btrfs": "btrfs"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:50:18.238344Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Every write creates new blocks:",
      "source_hash": 9865040891812766421,
      "context_hash": 4204528536929709293,
      "translation": "모든 쓰기는 새 블록을 생성합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:50:18.238344Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Subvolumes and snapshots",
      "source_hash": 14553430741659505936,
      "context_hash": 15428376467729591400,
      "translation": "서브볼륨과 스냅샷",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:50:18.238344Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "A **subvolume** is an independently rootable B-tree (its own root inode):",
      "source_hash": 18195709418550175863,
      "context_hash": 13415173074882924456,
      "translation": "**서브볼륨**(subvolume)은 독립적으로 루트를 가질 수 있는 B-tree(자체 루트 inode를 가짐)입니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "B-tree": "B-tree",
        "inode": "inode"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:50:18.238345Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Snapshot creation is O(1) — it just copies the B-tree root pointer.",
      "source_hash": 4286271314700963152,
      "context_hash": 8938916895232303011,
      "translation": "스냅샷 생성은 O(1)이며, B-tree 루트 포인터를 복사하기만 합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "B-tree": "B-tree"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:50:18.238345Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:1",
      "source": "Shared blocks are reference-counted in the extent tree.",
      "source_hash": 8122297369666302229,
      "context_hash": 18124881783732748932,
      "translation": "공유 블록은 extent 트리에서 참조 카운트로 관리됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:50:18.238345Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Extent tree: space accounting",
      "source_hash": 8831434504665863631,
      "context_hash": 1652133183163693467,
      "translation": "Extent 트리: 공간 어카운팅",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
